---
import MobileActorStage from "../MobileActorStage.astro";
---

<section
  class="observatory-chapter observatory-chapter--embodiment"
  id="embodiment"
  data-observatory-chapter="embodiment"
  aria-labelledby="embodiment-title"
>
  <div class="observatory-chapter-frame observatory-chapter-frame--trailing">
    <div class="observatory-copy observatory-panel observatory-identity-panel">
      <p class="observatory-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">LSO / 04</span>Embodiment</p>
      <h2 id="embodiment-title">一个能随主题重组、却始终保持同一身份的观测员</h2>
      <MobileActorStage pose="back-look" chapter="GUIDE / 04" cue="IDENTITY PERSISTS" />
      <p class="observatory-description">深色与浅色形态共享同一套八姿态动作图集：转身、迈步、回望与手势由真实轮廓交接，呼吸、视线和衣发延迟作为细微叠加。她不是装饰性吉祥物，而是研究、编程与个人兴趣之间的可视化接口。</p>
      <dl class="observatory-identity-grid">
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Signal Observer</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Mode</dt><dd>Void / Moon Paper</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Method</dt><dd>Structure → Evidence → Decision</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Temper</dt><dd>Precise · Tender · Curious</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a class="observatory-text-link" href="/about/">读取完整个人档案 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
